<title>USA: Donnkenny says names Lynn Siemers-Cross COO.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny says names Lynn Siemers-Cross COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnkenny Inc said Wednesday it had named Lynn Siemers-Cross president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>No further information was available from the company.</p>
</text>
